---
description: Sync completed and checked tasks to the existing GitHub upstream
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the automatic GitHub sync instructions in the repository root AGENTS.md.
After a completed task passes its relevant checks, review and commit only that task's paths.
The installed post-commit hook pushes the current branch to its existing upstream.
Do not commit secrets, unfinished work or another task's changes; never force push.
Report push failures and verify deployment separately from push success.
